; exit 0
; A `type` alias in a STRUCT FIELD, and the reference map it used to
; cost. Each line is the bytes the arena grew per iteration over
; 10,000 iterations after a 1,000-iteration warm-up, and both must
; read 0.
;
; `tests/selfhost/973-type-alias.ax` records the alias defect in
; ARGUMENT position - nominal where an argument is checked, transparent
; where a declared return is - and the fix expanded aliases over every
; SIGNATURE. A struct field is a signature position and was not in that
; sweep, so the alias stayed nominal there, and two things went wrong
; at once:
;
;   (Aliased 1 s)   AX3004: expected NID, found Int
;
; which is loud, and behind it the quiet one. `fldClass` answers 1 -
; unclassifiable - for a name that is neither a scalar nor a known
; `data`/`struct`, and an alias is neither; ONE unclassifiable field
; forces the whole block to a LEAF, and a leaf carries no map, so the
; `String` beside it is never walked when the block dies. The field
; that leaks is not the field that was misspelled - which is why this
; fixture puts the alias on the `Int` and measures the `String`.
;
; Measured before the fix, on the shapes below - the alias reached
; past AX3004 with a `cast`, since that is the only way to build one:
; the aliased spelling grew 80 bytes per iteration where the plain one
; grew 0, and the emitted shape word read 4 against 131076 - the same
; two fields, one of them no longer named as a reference. 80 is the
; same per-iteration figure the three shapes of `372` leaked before
; events 2 and 3, and for the same reason: a header nothing walks.
;
; An address-difference probe reads this as 112, which is `372`'s
; warning about the instrument arriving a second time - the 24-byte
; mark cells come back off a free list once reclamation works, so the
; addresses drift by an amount that is not the growth.
;
;   shape 0: a record whose FIRST field is spelled with an alias to
;            `Int` and whose second is a String, built and dropped
;   shape 1: the same record with the field spelled `Int` - the
;            control, and the reading shape 0 has to match
;
; The instrument is `372-arc-owned-results.ax`'s: the mark cell's word
; 0, the arena's bump, because a count-word read takes no share of its
; own and two cells' ADDRESSES say nothing once reclamation works.
; Word 2 is the chunk; a growth that crossed one answers 999999.
(import IO)

(import Str)

(type NID = Int)

(pub struct Aliased
  (nid : NID)
  (name : String))

(pub struct Plain
  (nid : Int)
  (name : String))

(:: t0 (-> Int Int))

(fn (t0 i)
  (let ((r (Aliased i (strConcat "nm-" (fmtInt i)))))
    (strLen r.name)
  )
)

(:: t1 (-> Int Int))

(fn (t1 i)
  (let ((r (Plain i (strConcat "nm-" (fmtInt i)))))
    (strLen r.name)
  )
)

(:: run (-> Int Int Int))

(fn (run which n)
  (let (
    (mut i 0)
    (mut acc 0)
  )
    {
      (while (< i n)
        {
          (set acc (+ acc (if (== which 0) (t0 i) (t1 i))))
          (set i (+ i 1))
        })
      acc
    }
  )
)

(:: measure (-> Int Int))

(fn (measure which)
  {
    (run which 1000)
    (let ((m0 __axiom_arena_mark))
      {
        (run which 10000)
        (let ((m1 __axiom_arena_mark))
          (if (!= (__load64 m1 2) (__load64 m0 2))
            999999
            (/ (- (__load64 m1 0) (__load64 m0 0)) 10000)
          )
        )
      }
    )
  }
)

(:: main Int)

;@axiom:effect(io)
(fn (main)
  (let ((mut w 0))
    {
      (while (< w 2)
        {
          (println (measure w))
          (set w (+ w 1))
        })
      0
    }
  )
)
